Emerging Market Opportunities
New semiconductor fabrication investments create opportunities for suppliers of high-purity resin products. Demand for specialized polishing materials may also increase as fabs strengthen controls over boron, peroxide and other residual impurities.

Suppliers can differentiate through pre-regenerated resin products, custom ultra-clean blends and technical support for resin selection and replacement. Improvements in resin stability and service life may also help customers manage water-treatment operating costs.

